From 50576917f5cc773729fb1702bf428ee86fbb3f9a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Starbite build <build@starbite.invalid>
Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 16:51:11 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] 0171: the same DLL as the system-wide ICD (file name
 sbgl-*.dll, loaded by the system opengl32 through sbglicd.dll): flag files
 from C:\ProgramData\Starbite\glsys instead of the game kit's, the new-GPU
 row's zero-copy default (0169) only in the kit, no softpipe under a process
 that cannot reach the Mali (no ICD pixel formats = Microsoft's OpenGL as
 before; glsys\softpipe brings it back), wgl.c's log lines only while the
 umdlog folder exists, first-chance exception log also under the sbgl-* names;
 the kit (libgallium_wgl.dll) behaves as before

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.2 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
